1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
क्या MRI scan permanent rewiring साबित करता है?

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Plasticity = experience के साथ neural change

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,800
एक universal brain-change score नहीं होता

4
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:18,600
Structural MRI: volume या thickness का अनुमान

5
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:23,300
Diffusion MRI: white-matter water diffusion signals

6
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:28,300
Task-fMRI: task के दौरान BOLD signal

7
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:33,000
BOLD signal indirect vascular measure है

8
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,700
Resting-state: synchronized fluctuations/connectivity

9
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:42,800
Scan change का मतलब हर बार skill gain नहीं

10
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:48,000
Learning, strategy, compensation या development?

11
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Processing choices भी interpretation बदल सकती हैं

12
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:58,500
Controls + before/after + behaviour जरूरी

13
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:03,500
“Guaranteed rewiring” claim से सावधान

14
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:08,000
Public education; diagnosis/treatment advice नहीं

15
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,900
AI narration और conceptual visuals disclosure
